# Demo of BVR-CLI Authentication Flow
Output docs/media/demo-auth.gif
Output docs/media/demo-auth.webm

Require bvr

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 30
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "bvr auth BVR-PREMIUM-KEY-2026"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Sleep 1s
# The CLI will say: Validating license key...
Sleep 1.5s
# The CLI will say: ✅ License key activated and saved successfully!

Sleep 3s
